From 9605adb9ece5acfd52fd503452dd482e829e4b7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:27:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] Access 9.2 A-1: the work resolver and the slice's
 scenario fields

lib/break_escape/access_work.rb resolves an NPC's work list, frustration
settings, workarounds, can-fail rule, use times, the desk rule, its places and
shortest use time for a need, the causes the server owns and the pace floors.
The schema and the validator's known-field lists accept every field of plan
section 4.
